From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Grische <github@grische.xyz>
Date: Sat, 15 Aug 2026 09:06:28 +0200
Subject: MIPS: intel-mips: enable the watchdog and pstore in grx500_defconfig

Turn on the watchdog menu and the new GRX500 driver, the pretimeout
governors, and the pstore ram backend that the FRITZ!Box 7560's reserved
ramoops region feeds.

Both governors are named explicitly rather than left to resolve from
WATCHDOG_CORE, because each is its own object file and an =m governor
would build a module nobody loads -- watchdog_notify_pretimeout() would
then find nothing registered and silently do nothing. The default is
noop: the driver's expiry interrupt has never run on this silicon, and a
spurious first countdown should not panic every boot. Switching to panic
at runtime is the point of building both, which is also why
WATCHDOG_SYSFS is on -- the whole attribute group, pretimeout_governor
included, lives inside that symbol's ifdef.

WATCHDOG_SYSFS also gives timeleft, which turns the hardware gate from
"wait and see whether it resets" into an observable countdown without
opening /dev/watchdog and thereby arming anything.

PSTORE_CONSOLE, not just the oops/panic records: a watchdog bite is not
an oops and never calls kmsg_dump, so the console zone is the only part
of pstore that captures a silent wedge -- which is exactly the case we
have no other post-mortem for. PSTORE_PMSG and PSTORE_FTRACE stay off;
userspace logging has other places to go and FTRACE is off here.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5
Signed-off-by: Grische <github@grische.xyz>

diff --git a/arch/mips/configs/grx500_defconfig b/arch/mips/configs/grx500_defconfig
index 6f35d44c323b..c619a89c4a0b 100644
--- a/arch/mips/configs/grx500_defconfig
+++ b/arch/mips/configs/grx500_defconfig
@@ -96,6 +96,13 @@ CONFIG_PINCTRL_EQUILIBRIUM=y
 CONFIG_POWER_RESET=y
 CONFIG_POWER_RESET_SYSCON=y
 # CONFIG_HWMON is not set
+CONFIG_WATCHDOG=y
+CONFIG_WATCHDOG_SYSFS=y
+CONFIG_WATCHDOG_PRETIMEOUT_GOV=y
+CONFIG_WATCHDOG_PRETIMEOUT_GOV_NOOP=y
+CONFIG_WATCHDOG_PRETIMEOUT_GOV_PANIC=y
+CONFIG_WATCHDOG_PRETIMEOUT_DEFAULT_GOV_NOOP=y
+CONFIG_INTEL_GRX500_WDT=y
 CONFIG_REGULATOR=y
 CONFIG_REGULATOR_FIXED_VOLTAGE=y
 # CONFIG_VGA_CONSOLE is not set
@@ -137,6 +144,9 @@ CONFIG_SQUASHFS_XATTR=y
 CONFIG_SQUASHFS_LZ4=y
 CONFIG_SQUASHFS_LZO=y
 CONFIG_SQUASHFS_XZ=y
+CONFIG_PSTORE=y
+CONFIG_PSTORE_CONSOLE=y
+CONFIG_PSTORE_RAM=y
 CONFIG_NLS=y
 CONFIG_PRINTK_TIME=y
 CONFIG_BOOT_PRINTK_DELAY=y
